# The dev checker (vite-plugin-checker) runs `eslint "./**/*"` from THIS dir,
# and eslint only reads the .eslintignore in its cwd — so the repo-root
# .eslintignore does NOT apply here. Without this file the checker lints
# build OUTPUT (hashed bundles) and crashes with ENOENT when a build artifact
# changes between enumeration and read. Never lint generated output.
build
dist
dev-dist
node_modules
coverage
